{"strongs": "H1254", "word": "בָּרָא", "translit": "ba.ra", "root": "בר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "shape, create", "definition": "I. בָּרָא 53 verb shape, create (compare Arabic probably loan-word, form, fashion by cutting, shape out, pare a reed for writing, a stick for an arrow , but also , create ; Phoenician הברא CIS i. 347 incisor, a trade involving cutting ; Assyrian barû , make , create , COT Gloss & Hpt KAT 2 Gloss 1 but dubious; Sabean ברא found, build , DHM ZMG 1883, 413, synonym בנה ; Ba ZA. 1888, 58 , compare Assyrian banû , create , beget , with change of liquid; Aramaic בְּרָא , , create ) — Qal Perfect Gen 1:1 + 19 t.; Imperfect יִבְרָא Gen 1:21 ; Gen 1:27 ; Num 16:30 Infinitive בְּראֹ Gen 5:1 Imperative בְּרָא Ps 51:12 Participle בּוֺרֵא Isa 42:5 + 10 t.; suffix בֹּרַאֲךָ Isa 43:1 בּוֺרְאֶיךָ Eccl 12:1 — shape, fashion, create , always of divine activity, with accusative of thing, seldom except in P and Isa 2 . 1. object heaven and earth Gen 1:1 ; Gen 2:3 ( P ) Isa 45:18 (twice in verse); mankind Gen 1:27 (3 t. in verse); Gen 5:1 ; Gen 5:2 ( P ) Gen 6:7 ( J ) Deut 4:32 ; Ps 89:48 ; Isa 45:12 the host of heaven Isa 40:26 heavens Isa 42:5 ends of the earth Isa 40:28 north and south Ps 89:13 wind Amos 4:13 the תנינים Gen 1:21 ( P ). 2. the individual man Mal 2:10 (|| father) Eccl 12:1 the smith and the waster Isa 54:16 (twice in verse); Israel as a nation Isa 43:15 Jacob Isa 43:1 the seed of Israel Isa 43:7 . 3. new conditions and circumstances: righteousness and salvation Isa 45:8 darkness and evil Isa 45:7 fruit of the lips Isa 57:19 a new thing חֲדָשָׁה (a woman encompassing a man) Jer 31:22 בְּרִיאָה (swallowing up the Korahites) Num 16:30 ( J ); cloud and flame over Zion Isa 4:5 . 4. of transformations: a clean heart Ps 51:12 (|| חִדֵּשׁ ); new heaven and earth Isa 65:17 (in place of old); transformation of nature Isa 41:20 with double accusative בורא ירושׁלם גילה transform Jerusalem into rejoicing Isa 65:18 . Niph`al Perfect 2 feminine singular נִבְרֵאתְ Ezek 21:35 3 plural נִבְרְאוּ Exod 34:10 + 2 t.; Imperfect יִבָּרֵא֑וּן Ps 104:30 Infinitive suffix הִבָּרַאֲךָ Ezek 28:13 הִבָּֽרְאָךְ Ezek 28:15 הִבָּֽרְאָם Gen 2:4 ; Gen 5:2 Participle נִבְרָא Ps 102:19 — Pass. 1. be created: heaven and earth Gen 2:4 ( P ); creatures Ps 104:30 mankind Gen 5:2 ( P ); heavens Ps 148:5 . 2. with reference to birth: במקום אשׁר נבראת in the place where thou wast created (i.e. native land) Ezek 21:35 יום הבראך day when thou wast created (king of Tyre) Ezek 28:13 ; Ezek 28:15 (compare היום ילדתיך Ps 2:7 ); עַם נִבְרָא Ps 102:19 (|| עַם נוֺלָד Ps 22:32 ). 3. of something new, astonishing: miracles Exod 34:10 ( J ); new things, חדשׁות Isa 48:6 . Pi`el Perfect בֵּרֵאתָ Josh 17:15 בֵּרֵאתוֺ Josh 17:18 Infinitive absolute בָּרֵא Ezek 21:24 (twice in verse); Ezek 23:47 — 1. cut down: a forest Josh 17:15 ; Josh 17:18 ( J ); וּבָרֵא אוֺתְהֶן בְּחַרְבוֺתָם Ezek 23:47 . 2. cut out: יָד hand, as an index Ezek 21:24 (twice in verse).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1300')\">BDB1300</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1254')\">H1254</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1299')\">BDB1299</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1301')\">BDB1301</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>בָּרָא</bdbheb><sub>53</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>shape, create</highlightword> (compare Arabic <placeholder688/> probably loan-word, <highlight>form, fashion by cutting, shape out, pare a reed for writing, a stick for an arrow</highlight>, but also <placeholder689/>, <highlight>create</highlight>; Phoenician <bdbheb>הברא</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('CIS')\">CIS<sup>i. 347</sup></lookup> <highlight>incisor, a trade involving cutting</highlight>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>barû</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>make</highlight>, <highlight>create</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('COT')\">COT<sup>Gloss &amp;</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hpt')\">Hpt</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('KAT')\">KAT<sup>2 Gloss 1</sup></lookup> but dubious; Sabean <bdbheb>ברא</bdbheb> <highlight>found, build</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 413, synonym</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>בנה</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>ZA. 1888, 58</sup></lookup>, compare Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>banû</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>create</highlight>, <highlight>beget</highlight>, with change of liquid; Aramaic <bdbarc>בְּרָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder690/>, <highlight>create</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,1)\">Gen 1:1</ref> + 19 t.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִבְרָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,21)\">Gen 1:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,27)\">Gen 1:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:30\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,30)\">Num 16:30</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>בְּראֹ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 5:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,1)\">Gen 5:1</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>בְּרָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,12)\">Ps 51:12</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>בּוֺרֵא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 42:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,5)\">Isa 42:5</ref> + 10 t.; suffix <bdbheb>בֹּרַאֲךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 43:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,1)\">Isa 43:1</ref> <bdbheb>בּוֺרְאֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:1\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,1)\">Eccl 12:1</ref> — <highlight>shape, fashion, create</highlight>, always of divine activity, with accusative of thing, seldom except in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Isa')\">Isa<sup>2</sup></lookup>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> object heaven and earth <ref ref=\"Gen 1:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,1)\">Gen 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 2:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,3)\">Gen 2:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 45:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,18)\">Isa 45:18</ref> (twice in verse); mankind <ref ref=\"Gen 1:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,27)\">Gen 1:27</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Gen 5:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,1)\">Gen 5:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 5:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,2)\">Gen 5:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Gen 6:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,7)\">Gen 6:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Deut 4:32\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,32)\">Deut 4:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:48\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,48)\">Ps 89:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,12)\">Isa 45:12</ref> the host of heaven <ref ref=\"Isa 40:26\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,26)\">Isa 40:26</ref> heavens <ref ref=\"Isa 42:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,5)\">Isa 42:5</ref> ends of the earth <ref ref=\"Isa 40:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,28)\">Isa 40:28</ref> north and south <ref ref=\"Ps 89:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,13)\">Ps 89:13</ref> wind <ref ref=\"Amos 4:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,13)\">Amos 4:13</ref> the <bdbheb>תנינים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,21)\">Gen 1:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> the individual man <ref ref=\"Mal 2:10\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(39,2,10)\">Mal 2:10</ref> (|| father) <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:1\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,1)\">Eccl 12:1</ref> the smith and the waster <ref ref=\"Isa 54:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,16)\">Isa 54:16</ref> (twice in verse); Israel as a nation <ref ref=\"Isa 43:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,15)\">Isa 43:15</ref> Jacob <ref ref=\"Isa 43:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,1)\">Isa 43:1</ref> the seed of Israel <ref ref=\"Isa 43:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,7)\">Isa 43:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> new conditions and circumstances: righteousness and salvation <ref ref=\"Isa 45:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,8)\">Isa 45:8</ref> darkness and evil <ref ref=\"Isa 45:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,7)\">Isa 45:7</ref> fruit of the lips <ref ref=\"Isa 57:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,19)\">Isa 57:19</ref> a new thing <bdbheb>חֲדָשָׁה</bdbheb> (a woman encompassing a man) <ref ref=\"Jer 31:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,22)\">Jer 31:22</ref> <bdbheb>בְּרִיאָה</bdbheb> (swallowing up the Korahites) <ref ref=\"Num 16:30\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,30)\">Num 16:30</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); cloud and flame over Zion <ref ref=\"Isa 4:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,5)\">Isa 4:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> of transformations: a clean heart <ref ref=\"Ps 51:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,12)\">Ps 51:12</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חִדֵּשׁ</bdbheb>); new heaven and earth <ref ref=\"Isa 65:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,17)\">Isa 65:17</ref> (in place of old); transformation of nature <ref ref=\"Isa 41:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,20)\">Isa 41:20</ref> with double accusative <bdbheb>בורא ירושׁלם גילה</bdbheb> <highlight>transform Jerusalem into rejoicing</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,18)\">Isa 65:18</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 2 feminine singular <bdbheb>נִבְרֵאתְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:35\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,35)\">Ezek 21:35</ref> 3 plural <bdbheb>נִבְרְאוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 34:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,10)\">Exod 34:10</ref> + 2 t.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִבָּרֵא֑וּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 104:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,30)\">Ps 104:30</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>הִבָּרַאֲךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,13)\">Ezek 28:13</ref> <bdbheb>הִבָּֽרְאָךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,15)\">Ezek 28:15</ref> <bdbheb>הִבָּֽרְאָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,4)\">Gen 2:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 5:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,2)\">Gen 5:2</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נִבְרָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 102:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,19)\">Ps 102:19</ref> — <highlight>Pass.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be created:</highlight> heaven and earth <ref ref=\"Gen 2:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,4)\">Gen 2:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); creatures <ref ref=\"Ps 104:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,30)\">Ps 104:30</ref> mankind <ref ref=\"Gen 5:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,2)\">Gen 5:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); heavens <ref ref=\"Ps 148:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,5)\">Ps 148:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> with reference to birth: <bdbheb>במקום אשׁר נבראת</bdbheb> <highlight>in the place where thou wast created</highlight> (i.e. native land) <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:35\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,35)\">Ezek 21:35</ref> <bdbheb>יום הבראך</bdbheb> <highlight>day when thou wast created</highlight> (king of Tyre) <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,13)\">Ezek 28:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,15)\">Ezek 28:15</ref> (compare <bdbheb>היום ילדתיך</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 2:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,7)\">Ps 2:7</ref>); <bdbheb>עַם נִבְרָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 102:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,19)\">Ps 102:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עַם נוֺלָד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:32\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,32)\">Ps 22:32</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> of something new, astonishing: miracles <ref ref=\"Exod 34:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,10)\">Exod 34:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); new things, <bdbheb>חדשׁות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 48:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,6)\">Isa 48:6</ref>. <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>בֵּרֵאתָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 17:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,15)\">Josh 17:15</ref> <bdbheb>בֵּרֵאתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 17:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,18)\">Josh 17:18</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> absolute <bdbheb>בָּרֵא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,24)\">Ezek 21:24</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:47\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,47)\">Ezek 23:47</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>cut down:</highlight> a forest <ref ref=\"Josh 17:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,15)\">Josh 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 17:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,18)\">Josh 17:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>וּבָרֵא אוֺתְהֶן בְּחַרְבוֺתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:47\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,47)\">Ezek 23:47</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>cut out:</highlight> <bdbheb>יָד</bdbheb> hand, as an index <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,24)\">Ezek 21:24</ref> (twice in verse). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 1:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 1:21", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 1, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Gen 1:27", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 1, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Num 16:30", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 16, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Gen 5:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ps 51:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 51, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 42:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 42, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Isa 43:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 43, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Eccl 12:1", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 2:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 45:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 45, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Gen 5:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Gen 6:7", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 6, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Deut 4:32", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Ps 89:48", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 48}, {"raw": "Isa 45:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 45, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 40:26", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 40, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Isa 40:28", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 40, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ps 89:13", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Amos 4:13", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Mal 2:10", "book": "MAL", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "I